# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit the real values.
# Set the same values in each host's environment: Vercel - Project Settings >
# Environment Variables; yooj.care's Cloudflare Worker "yooj-web-app" -
# Settings > Variables and Secrets, as a Secret.
#
# DECK_KEY unlocks the sealed deck in deck/sealed and signs readers' passes.
# `npm run deck:seal -- path/to/deck.pdf` generates one into .env.local if it
# is missing. Without it /deck answers "unavailable".
DECK_KEY=

# Deck visits and "Join the YOOJ network" sign-ups go from the visitor's
# browser to two Google Forms (linked to their spreadsheets). They need no
# variables anywhere: which forms, and which questions, is in
# integrations/google-forms/forms.json.
